2Ki 19:1 , Hezekiah mourning, sends to Isaiah to pray for them;
2Ki 19:6 , Isaiah comforts them;
2Ki 19:8 , Sennacherib, going to encounter Tirhakah, sends a blasphemous letter to Hezekiah;
2Ki 19:14 , Hezekiah's prayer;
2Ki 19:20 , Isaiah's prophecy of the pride and destruction of Sennacherib, and the good of Zion;
2Ki 19:35 , An angel slays the Assyrians;
2Ki 19:36 , Sennacherib is slain by his own sons.
